    title: 'Rate Limit Overview',
    description:
      "Rate limit status for the applicable requester and resource category. Requests\nauthenticated as a user share the user's rate limit across credentials. Requests\nwithout authentication use the requesting IP address. API requests routed through\neither an API hostname or a web hostname can count against the same applicable limit.",
